{"availability":"available","full":"ctxrs/figma-server","name":"figma-server","description":"Figma is hostile to your agents, so just run figma-server for full access over CDP","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T16:22:08Z","updated":"2026-10-02T21:57:02Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Figma wants to choose which agents can use your files through its MCP server. They would also like you to use their agent. This is clearly an untenable position for them. The inevitable conclusion is that people have their own agents. This could be a personal agent, a coding agent, an enterprise agent, or whatever. We're not going to have 1000 agents for 1000 different apps and services. We're going to have one agent and give it tools!","Figma is a tool. And I will happily pay for it as I have for years. But I'm not going to use the Figma agent."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ctxrs/figma-server/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2a32e94d2204b7f77733b3976373b50372e9c4473b2e3c928c9f9b440bec7a2f","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:53.619Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Figma wants to choose which agents can use your files through its MCP server. They would also like you to use their agent. This is clearly an untenable position for them. The inevitable conclusion is that people have their own agents. This could be a personal agent, a coding agent, an enterprise agent, or whatever. We're not going to have 1000 agents for 1000 different apps and ser